            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "什么是 Redis 的雪崩、穿透和击穿？"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "Redis 崩溃之后会发生什么？"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "系统该如何应对这种情况？"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "如何处理 Redis 的缓存穿透？"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "面试官心理分析"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "面试官心理分析"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "缓存雪崩与穿透是缓存体系中最致命的两个问题。一旦触发，往往会造成数据库被打挂、系统整体不可用，因此是缓存相关面试的必考点。回答时应区分三者的触发条件、典型场景和防御手段，并能结合高可用、限流、降级、数据预热等架构方案说明。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 3,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "缓存雪崩"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "缓存雪崩"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "定义"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "定义"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "缓存雪崩（Cache Avalanche）指在某一时刻，缓存层整体不可用（如 Redis 集群全盘宕机、大面积缓存同时过期），导致原本由缓存承担的请求瞬间全部打到数据库，数据库压力骤增并被压垮。即使 DBA 重启数据库，也会被持续涌入的流量再次打挂。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "典型场景"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "典型场景"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "ordered": false,
        "start": null,
        "spread": false,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "高峰期流量为每秒 5000 请求，缓存原本可承载 4000 请求/秒。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "缓存机器意外全盘宕机，5000 请求/秒全部落库，数据库报警后崩溃。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "spread": false,
            "checked": null,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "value": "重启数据库后，新流量继续涌入，系统进入“重启即被打死”的循环。"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "流程示意"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "流程示意"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "配图内容描述：用户请求先到达系统 A，系统 A 尝试访问 Redis 缓存，但缓存机器已宕机，最终所有请求直接落到数据库，数据库被打挂。"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "code",
        "lang": "mermaid",
        "meta": null,
        "value": "flowchart TD\n    U([用户]) -->|高峰期每秒 5000 请求| A[系统 A]\n    A -->|访问缓存| R[缓存<br/>机器宕机]\n    R -. 缓存不可用 .-> A\n    A -->|缓存挂了，请求全部落库| D[(数据库)]\n    D -->|扛不住流量| D_DOWN[数据库崩溃]"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "depth": 4,
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "解决方案：事前、事中、事后"
          }
        ],
        "data": {
          "headingId": "解决方案事前事中事后"
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "table",
        "align": [
          null,
          null,
          null
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "tableRow",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
                "children": []
              },
              {
                "type": "tableCell",
